// CR 702.51a-c (convoke taps creatures to pay generic or a matching color), 601.2h (payment
// order), 701.23a-b (up to two basic lands), 701.24a (shuffle) and 614.1d/614.12 (the found lands enter
// tapped).
// Pinned 2024-01-12 rulings: convoke applies after the total cost is computed, doesn't change
// the mana cost or mana value, and may tap a creature not controlled since the turn began.
// Convoke is the shipped `keywords: [Convoke]` spell keyword (Appeal to Eirdu, Arboretum
// Elemental); the search is the reviewed Circuitous Route shape.
(
  id: "nissas_expedition",
  name: "Nissa's Expedition",
  face_id: "nissas_expedition",
  mana_cost: "{4}{G}",
  types: ["Sorcery"],
  keywords: [Convoke],
  spell_effect: [SearchLibrary(
    count: 2,
    filter: Some((card_type: Some(BasicLand))),
    destination: Battlefield(tapped: true),
  )],
)
